# Feature 004 (story 2, scenario 4): Cancel on the combined confirmation changes nothing: no download, no write, the banner is still there.
# scenario demo
# expect-unchanged
size 1404 1872
wait 400
tap refresh
waitfor catalogLine Catalog last updated
expect updateNotice 1 update available
tap updateAllButton
waitfor updateAllIntro
expect_count updateAllEntry 1
shot @OUT@/35-update-all-cancel.png
tap cancel
waitfor appRow
expect_absent updateAllIntro
expect updateNotice 1 update available
quit
